      en: ["Eleuthera was the world's leading pineapple exporter in the 1800s.", "The 'Sugarloaf' variety is prized for its high sugar content and soft core.", "It takes between 18 to 24 months for a single pineapple to mature.", "The island’s distinct red soil is heavily enriched with iron oxide.", "The annual Pineapple Festival has been held in Gregory Town since 1988.", "Pineapple cultivation on the island began in the early 18th century."],
