      en: ["Spans a massive area of approximately 141 acres.", "The 'Leap of Faith' slide features a near-vertical 60-foot drop.", "Over 20 million gallons of water are circulated through the park daily.", "Part of an ecosystem housing more than 50,000 marine animals.", "The 'Power Tower' stands as the tallest slide tower in the park.", "The facility offers 11 unique swimming pools to guests."],
