      en: ["The factory was established in 1968 on Grand Bahama island.", "It is located in a historic building known as 'Fragrance House'.", "Visitors can choose from over 20 different base notes for blending.", "Perfumes are produced without animal testing using natural extracts.", "A famous signature scent from the factory is 'Sand' perfume.", "The facility is situated near the International Bazaar in Freeport."],
